node_modules/
dist/
.env
# The embedding model the bundler ships. 130MB of weights that are not ours and do not belong in
# anyone's clone or in this history; `fetch-model.sh` puts them here before a release build. The
# README in that directory stays: it is what the bundler's glob matches when the model is absent,
# which is what lets `just dev` build without staging 130MB first.
/src-tauri/resources/model/*
!/src-tauri/resources/model/README.md
